# Live MCP docs

This repo is `@modelcontextprotocol/server` **v2** (Bun + stdio). Training data will hallucinate v1 `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`.

When the task touches protocol or SDK APIs, load the `mcp-docs` skill and read live docs:

1. **Protocol / Inspector / spec** — MCP server `mcp-protocol-docs` (`search_model_context_protocol`). Index: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/llms.txt (prefer `2026-07-28`).
2. **TypeScript SDK v2** — https://ts.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io/v2/llms.txt then the page's `.md` URL. Or Context7 library `/websites/ts_sdk_modelcontextprotocol_io_v2`.

Do not scaffold a new MCP project. Do not copy v1 APIs (`.tool()`, `McpError`, `extra`, SSE).
